# #5239: enforcement judges an enveloped value's envelope bytes, which no
# policy accepts, instead of its body.
MODULE: ValidBodyNeverRefusedByEnforcementJudgesEnvelope
TARGET: ValidBodyNeverRefusedByEnforcement
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an enveloped entry with a valid body is refused by enforcement
PERTURBS: RunEnforcement

--- FIND
    /\ IF ~policyOn \/ val.body = "Good"
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF ~policyOn \/ (val.form = "Raw" /\ val.body = "Good")
--- END
